tiful  and versatile adding a gourmet look  simply toss together your rice with  roasted sweet potato brussels sprouts  pecans pepitas dried cranberries and  leftover turkey  finally i have a better for you dessert  that's single serve and customizable  these are six ingredient crisps in  blueberry strawberry and apple topped  with wonder creamery cork  this european style cultured dairy  staple has a non-tart flavor with  buttery notes  a thick creamy texture and is high in  protein calcium and probiotics which are  beneficial bacteria that support  digestion and immune health to make  simply add your fruit of choice to a  pre-greased oven-safe skillet  and bake for 10 minutes at 350 degrees  fahrenheit mix together a fourth cup of  blanched almond flour  1 teaspoon of cinnamon 1 tablespoon of  maple syrup  and 1 tablespoon of oil crumble on top  of your fruit and bake for another 10  minutes  then top with your wonder creamery cork  now i hope you enjoyed all of these  healthier holiday recipes you can find  them at my website nutritionbymia.com  and nutritionbymia on instagram where i  also share  meal ideas and nutrition tips daily
 

